<h3 data-start="684" data-end="717" data-section-id="1bo8cwg"><span role="text">2. <code data-start="691" data-end="703">index.html</code> me logo lagao</span></h3>
<p data-start="719" data-end="754"><code data-start="719" data-end="727">&lt;head&gt;</code> ke andar ye line add karo:</p>
